@host = http://localhost:3000
@accessToken = REPLACE_WITH_ACCESS_TOKEN
@itemId = REPLACE_WITH_24_CHARACTER_ITEM_ID
@claimId = REPLACE_WITH_24_CHARACTER_CLAIM_ID

### Health
GET {{host}}/api/v1/health

### Get CSRF cookie / token (use for refresh/logout)
GET {{host}}/api/v1/auth/csrf

### Log in (copy accessToken; client saves HttpOnly refresh cookie)
POST {{host}}/api/v1/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{"email":"sara@campus.edu","password":"Demo12345!"}

### List reported items
GET {{host}}/api/v1/items?category=Electronics&sort=newest&page=1&limit=10
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### Create report
POST {{host}}/api/v1/items
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"title":"Lost library headphones","description":"Black wireless headphones with a small red sticker on the band","category":"Electronics","location":"Main Library","date":"2026-10-27","type":"lost"}

### See matches (reporter or moderator only)
GET {{host}}/api/v1/items/{{itemId}}/matches
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### Claim item (cannot claim own report)
POST {{host}}/api/v1/items/{{itemId}}/claims
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"proofText":"The left side has a scratch near the hinge and a unique marking on the underside."}

### Approve (reporter/moderator)
PATCH {{host}}/api/v1/claims/{{claimId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"status":"approved"}

### Moderator GraphQL dashboard
POST {{host}}/graphql
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"query":"query { itemStats { total byStatus { label count } byCategory { label count } } recentClaims(limit: 5) { id status } }"}
